    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Each time a unit of yours with **Martial Ka’tah** is picked to fight, choose a Ka’tah Stance for it. Until the unit's attacks are all resolved, that Stance is active and the unit has its ability:\n\n- **Dacatari Stance**: its models' melee weapons get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Rendax Stance**: its models' melee weapons get **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.",
